WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:04.190
For so long,

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:12.860
I had Larry in my ear or in my face telling
me what was real, what was not.

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:16.210
What was me, what was not.

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:21.010
I have no idea what's true.

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:30.470
Other than what I saw myself that I can
remember right now in this moment, sitting

00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:36.710
here talking to you. I don't I mean, you
know, even part of that, how much it was of

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:40.250
that was real or true or was it, you know.

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:42.410
Can I ask you one question?

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:42.560
Yes.

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:44.510
Do you remember meeting Bernard Kerik?

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:49.010
When I was little? Yeah, because they knew my
family.Yeah.

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:56.240
Okay. So you remember meeting Bernard Kerik,
but is there any way that that could not be

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:56.870
true?

00:00:57.410 --> 00:01:02.240
That's very unlikely. So.

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:03.650
But you see you.

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:07.000
Right. But you see where I am now?

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:07.910
Yeah.

00:01:08.180 --> 00:01:09.500
What's real?

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:14.960
What's what's the truth? I don't know.

